# Graphify corpus lock — INTAFACED
# Official mechanism: https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify#ignoring-files
# .gitignore is also respected (vendor, node_modules, .worktrees).
#
# Only product code is in the graph. Swarm boards / paste walls / ROI audits
# stay out — those go stale and would poison query results.

# Allowlist: services + packages only
*
!services/
!services/**
!packages/
!packages/**

# Code graph is AST-only. Service READMEs would trigger a semantic (LLM) pass
# for almost no extra map, and would recost every --update.
**/*.md
**/*.mdx
**/*.html
**/*.txt

# Never index the graph's own output
graphify-out/
